abstract: >-
  Pipeline notebook and derived result tables for a comparison of tryptic-peptide,
  3-mer, peptide-topic and amino-acid-composition representations for Gene Ontology
  term prediction, with ESM-2 embeddings and homology transfer as reference points.
keywords:
  - protein function prediction
  - tokenization
  - Gene Ontology
  - tryptic peptides
  - out-of-vocabulary
  - evaluation methodology
